---
export const prerender = false;

import HelpLayout from '@/layouts/HelpLayout.astro';

const REPO = 'https://github.com/katomm/dreptalk.com';
---

<HelpLayout
  title="Open source - DRepTalk"
  description="DRepTalk is open source under the Apache 2.0 license. The full code is on GitHub and contributions are welcome."
  crumb="Open source"
>
  <p style="color:var(--muted);max-width:62ch;line-height:1.6;">
    DRepTalk is open source, released under the <strong>Apache 2.0</strong> license.
    The entire codebase is public on
    <a href={REPO} rel="noopener" target="_blank">GitHub</a>, so anyone can read how the
    platform works, audit how on-chain data and wallet sign-in are handled, and run their
    own copy. For a forum built around Cardano governance, that transparency is the point.
  </p>

  <section style="margin-top:1.75rem;">
    <h2 style="margin:0 0 0.25rem;font-size:1.0625rem;">Contributions are welcome</h2>
    <p style="margin:0;max-width:62ch;font-size:0.9375rem;line-height:1.6;color:var(--muted);">
      We would love your help. Found a bug, spotted a wrong status, or have an idea that
      would make the forum better? Open an issue or a pull request on
      <a href={REPO} rel="noopener" target="_blank">GitHub</a>. Documentation fixes, design
      feedback, and translations are just as valuable as code. If you are unsure where to
      start, open an issue describing what you have in mind and we will help you scope it.
    </p>
  </section>
</HelpLayout>
